# Query key invariants

- Define keys in `ui/src/api/hooks.ts` as `queryKeys`
- **Same key ⇒ same `queryFn` semantics and response shape**
- Include `symbol`, `dataMode`, IDs when response depends on them
- Document intentional shared caches (e.g. `canary-snapshot`)

See [ADR-0004](docs/architecture/adr/0004-react-query-key-invariants.md) and [FRONTEND_GUIDE.md](docs/engineering/FRONTEND_GUIDE.md).
